<title>USA: SmithKline gets Wal-Mart drug-test contract.</title>
<headline>SmithKline gets Wal-Mart drug-test contract.</headline>
<dateline>COLLEGEVILLE, Pa. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>SmithKline Beecham Plc said Monday it has an agreement to perform workplace drug testing for Wal-Mart Stores Inc in the United States and Puerto Rico.</p>
<p>SmithKline said the tests, which include testing for more than 675,000 Mart associates in 2,700 retail and distribution centers nationwide, covers all domestic Wal-Mart Store associates and SAM'S Clubs partners.</p>
<p>A SmithKline spokesman declined to say how much money the contract is worth.</p>
